=========================================================
  IPC Performance Benchmark: Single-Copy vs. Zero-Copy   
  Iterations: 10000000 messages (52 bytes each) 
=========================================================

[1] Single-Copy (memcpy):
    Time taken:   0.1123 seconds
    Throughput:   89.04 Million msg/sec
    Latency:      11.2 ns per round-trip

[2] Zero-Copy (In-Place reserve/commit):
    Time taken:   0.0648 seconds
    Throughput:   154.28 Million msg/sec
    Latency:      6.5 ns per round-trip

=========================================================
